.SH NAME
pushpin \- HTTP reverse proxy server supporting streaming and long-polling services.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pushpin
.RI [--verbose] " " --config= CONFIG

.SH DESCRIPTION
This starts
.B pushpin
using the specified configuration (pushpin.conf).

In the default configuration, this also starts mongrel2, m2adapter, pushpin-proxy, pushpin-handler, zurl.

.SH "SEE ALSO"
\&\fImongrel2\fR\|(1)
\&\fIm2adapter\fR\|(1)
\&\fIpushpin-proxy\fR\|(1)
\&\fIpushpin-handler\fR\|(1)
\&\fIzurl\fR\|(1)
